{"key": "b04247c60bc119377ee78441", "response": {"id": "msg_011CgAaAqV14vp4Vu3FNMjph", "container": null, "content": [{"text": "**Buy Nov CPI YES for $142: it zeroes the book either way, and it's the only hedge that works.**\n\nThe contract is the exact event, so there's no basis risk on the event. The only slack is that the $992 loss is a \u03b2 estimate, and \u03b2 has a wide error band. The cost is 12.5\u00a2 per $1 covered. That is 1,134 contracts, and the book lands at $0 if YES and $0 if NO. You give up the $142 you'd make on NO.\n\nThe option hedges are worse. The SPY, QQQ, TLT and USO options all cost $219 to $611, and each leaves a loss if YES (the SPY spread leaves $1,200). They also bleed if NO, so skip them.\n\nDo you want the contract as a full hedge, or a half-size one to keep some of the NO upside?", "type": "text"}], "diagnostics": null, "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_details": null, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 2578}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2578, "cache_read_input_tokens": 10646, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4, "iterations": [{"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 2578}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2578, "cache_read_input_tokens": 10646, "input_tokens": 4, "model": null, "output_tokens": 263, "type": "message"}], "output_tokens": 263, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}}
